  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "How it forms",
   "texto": [
    "In the verbs in **-are** and **-ere**, the conditional root usually ends in **-er-**: **parlare → parlerei**, **prendere → prenderei**. **-ire** verbs keep **-ir-**: **dormire → dormirei**. The endings are **-ei, -esti, -ebbe, -emmo, -este, -ebbero**.",
    "Some verbs are irregular in the root: **avere → avrei**, **essere → sarei**, **andare → andrei**, **fare → farei**."
   ]
